---
import { restaurant } from '../data/restaurant';
---

<section id="tentang" class="py-12 sm:py-16 lg:py-20 bg-[#F4EEE3]/50 border-y border-stone-200/60">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-10 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:gap-14 items-center">
      <!-- Left: Story Text -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-6">
        <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-amber-800">
          <span class="h-1 w-5 rounded-full bg-amber-600"></span>
          <span>Tentang Kami</span>
        </div>

        <h2 class="mt-2 text-2xl sm:text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-stone-900 leading-tight">
          Cerita Tradisi &amp; Cita Rasa Sunda di Walahar
        </h2>

        <div class="mt-4 flex flex-col gap-3 text-stone-600 leading-relaxed text-sm sm:text-base">
          {restaurant.description.map((paragraph) => (
            <p>{paragraph}</p>
          ))}
        </div>

        <!-- Cash Only Alert Box -->
        <div class="mt-6 flex items-start gap-3 rounded-2xl border border-amber-200/80 bg-amber-50/80 p-4 text-xs sm:text-sm text-amber-900">
          <svg class="h-5 w-5 shrink-0 text-amber-700 mt-0.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/>
            <line x1="12" y1="8" x2="12" y2="12"/>
            <line x1="12" y1="16" x2="12.01" y2="16"/>
          </svg>
          <div>
            <span class="font-bold">Informasi Pembayaran:</span>
            <p class="mt-0.5 text-amber-800/90">Saat ini transaksi di rumah makan melayani pembayaran tunai (cash).</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Right: Feature Cards Grid -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-6">
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
          <div class="rounded-2xl border border-stone-200/80 bg-white p-5 shadow-xs transition-transform hover:-translate-y-0.5">
            <div class="flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-800 mb-3">
              <svg class="h-5 w-5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                <path d="M12 2a10 10 0 1 0 10 10A10 10 0 0 0 12 2zm0 18a8 8 0 1 1 8-8 8 8 0 0 1-8 8z"/>
                <path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"/>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-stone-900">Ikan Jambal Roti</h3>
            <p class="mt-1 text-xs text-stone-500 leading-relaxed">
              Daging ikan tebal dengan tekstur empuk dan gurih pas, diolah secara higienis setiap hari.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="rounded-2xl border border-stone-200/80 bg-white p-5 shadow-xs transition-transform hover:-translate-y-0.5">
            <div class="flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-amber-100 text-amber-800 mb-3">
              <svg class="h-5 w-5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                <path d="M11 20A7 7 0 0 1 9.8 6.1C15.5 5 17 4.48 19 2c1 2 2 4.18 2 8 0 5.5-4.78 10-10 10Z"/>
                <path d="M2 21c0-3 1.85-5.36 5.08-6C9.5 14.52 12 13 13 12"/>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-stone-900">Bungkus Daun Alami</h3>
            <p class="mt-1 text-xs text-stone-500 leading-relaxed">
              Dikukus dan dibakar berbalut daun pisang segar untuk menghasilkan aroma harum yang khas.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="rounded-2xl border border-stone-200/80 bg-white p-5 shadow-xs transition-transform hover:-translate-y-0.5">
            <div class="flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-rose-100 text-rose-800 mb-3">
              <svg class="h-5 w-5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                <path d="M12 3c-1.5 0-3 .5-4 1.5-1.5 1.5-2 3.5-1.5 5.5.5 2 2 3.5 3.5 5 1 1 2 2 2 3 0-1 1-2 2-3 1.5-1.5 3-3 3.5-5 .5-2 0-4-1.5-5.5-1-1-2.5-1.5-4-1.5z"/>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-stone-900">Rempah Khas Sunda</h3>
            <p class="mt-1 text-xs text-stone-500 leading-relaxed">
              Kombinasi cabai, bawang, serai, kunyit, dan daun kemangi segar yang meresap hingga ke tulang.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="rounded-2xl border border-stone-200/80 bg-white p-5 shadow-xs transition-transform hover:-translate-y-0.5">
            <div class="flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-blue-100 text-blue-800 mb-3">
              <svg class="h-5 w-5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                <path d="M20 10c0 6-8 12-8 12s-8-6-8-12a8 8 0 0 1 16 0Z"/>
                <circle cx="12" cy="10" r="3"/>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-stone-900">Dekat Bendungan</h3>
            <p class="mt-1 text-xs text-stone-500 leading-relaxed">
              Mudah dijangkau di kawasan Walahar, menjadi tempat singgah favorit keluarga dan rombongan.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
